OL,3,GNEWSAOlympian Ciara Mageean was a
OL,4,A'talented and inspirational human
OL,5,Abeing'
OL,6,
OL,7,FOlympian Ciara Mageean has been
OL,8,Fdescribed as a "truly remarkable,
OL,9,Fimmensely talented and inspirational
OL,10,Fhuman being" in a tribute read out at
OL,11,Fher funeral.
OL,13,FHundreds of people have paid their
OL,14,Frespects to the runner at her funeral
OL,15,Fon Tuesday.
OL,17,FThe former European champion and
OL,18,Ftwo-time Olympic runner died on Sunday
OL,19,Fafter she was diagnosed with stage four
OL,20,Fbowel cancer.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
