OL,3,GNEWSAOlympian Ciara Mageean was a
OL,4,A'talented and inspirational human
OL,5,Abeing'
OL,6,
OL,7,FAmong those in attendance at the
OL,8,Ffuneral in Portaferry, County Down,
OL,9,Fwere Northern Ireland First Minister
OL,10,FMichelle O'Neill, as well as fellow
OL,11,FOlympian Rhys McClenaghan and 1972 gold
OL,12,Fmedallist Lady Mary Peters.
